<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Trick, Disguise, Tricked!</font>

45
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:36,650
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{The Grand Bug Mega Battle</font>

46
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck is happening...?</font>

47
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:43,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does Hinata have
to be kidnapped?!</font>

48
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are there guys who know
that we're searching for Bikochu?!</font>

49
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were being watched all this time.
Ever since we arrived...</font>

50
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were aware of that?!</font>

51
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only one who didn't know.</font>

52
00:01:56,510 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you tell me?!</font>

53
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because if we told you
you'd have raised a big fuss!</font>

54
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the insects would flee!
All the insects...!</font>

55
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Including the Bikochu!</font>

56
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they tried to steal the Bikochu
from us through force</font>

57
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the insects would be in danger
of getting hurt.</font>

58
00:02:16,990 --> 00:02:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So they captured Hinata and
decided to go with a hostage exchange.</font>

59
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's very smart of them.</font>

60
00:02:24,290 --> 00:02:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something smells sweet...</font>

61
00:02:26,410 --> 00:02:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the smell of honey.</font>

62
00:02:28,290 --> 00:02:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bee's honey...</font>

63
00:02:29,670 --> 00:02:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bees...?</font>

64
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's scent ends here...</font>

65
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

66
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys waited for a moment when
Hinata was alone</font>

67
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attacked her using bees.</font>

68
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard that in the Hidden Stone Village
in the Land of Earth</font>

69
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a clan of insect handlers
who primarily use bees.</font>

70
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The name of that clan is...
the Kamizuru Clan.</font>

71
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kamizuru...? That's a name
that isn't heard very often.</font>

72
00:03:05,330 --> 00:03:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems they were once hailed as being
at a level equal to the Aburame Clan...</font>

73
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But they aren't anymore?</font>

74
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a story from
the times of my grandfather...</font>

75
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:19,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was a time when the Shinobi
of the Hidden Stone Village</font>

76
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">were going to invade the Leaf Village...</font>

77
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kamizuru Clan was designated
to spearhead the operation...</font>

78
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:28,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The plan was to create
a disruption by releasing</font>

79
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a large swarm of bees into the village
followed by an invading main unit...</font>

80
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the Aburame Clan
wised up to that</font>

81
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:37,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and prepared to engage the enemy
in the forest to the west!</font>

82
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This battle between insect handlers
which had no precedent in history...</font>

83
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ended in the Aburame's victory...</font>

84
00:03:59,090 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this battle as the turning point</font>

85
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Aburame Clan rose to
unchallenged status</font>

86
00:04:02,970 --> 00:04:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

87
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the other hand the Kamizuru Clan
was subjected to cold treatment</font>

88
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even in their own village.</font>

89
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard that only a few of them
remain now...</font>

90
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So those people came here
to capture Bikochu, huh?</font>

91
00:04:19,690 --> 00:04:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck are those guys
planning to do with the Bikochu?</font>

92
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my insects come back
we might be able to learn something...</font>

93
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... I've been captured...</font>

94
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves is
in a difficult situation right now...</font>

95
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of that incident
at the recent Chunin exam?</font>

96
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage was assassinated
and I hear they lost many Shinobi too.</font>

97
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Times are about to change dramatically...</font>

98
00:05:26,470 --> 00:05:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a chance for us
the Kamizuru Clan</font>

99
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to distinguish ourselves.</font>

100
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:33,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to do that...</font>

101
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The founder's Book of Secrets, huh?</font>

102
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A broad range of Forbidden Jutsu
for Insect Handlers</font>

103
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are apparently inscribed therein
among other things...</font>

104
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we possessed that at the time of
the battle with the Aburame Clan</font>

105
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we wouldn't have lost...</font>

106
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, Clan members have continued
to search for it for many years</font>

107
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but couldn't find it.</font>

108
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really think
we can find it after all this time?</font>

109
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we need the Bikochu...</font>

110
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I brought the keepsakes
of the founder, my grandfather with me...</font>

111
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the Bikochu emerges
it will pursue the scent it recognizes.</font>

112
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we should be able
to locate the Book of Secrets</font>

113
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Grandfather hid just
as he was dying.</font>

114
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:18,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This strand of his hair
will surely lead us to it.</font>

115
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we get our hands on
the Book of Secrets</font>

116
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if we engage in some big action...</font>

117
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am certain that... the people of
the village will also acknowledge us.</font>

118
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those people are also desperately
seeking recognition.</font>

119
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

120
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:56,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you find out anything?
How about Hinata's whereabouts?</font>

121
00:06:56,720 --> 00:07:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... The other insects were probably
also done in by those guys.</font>

122
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Then our only choice
is to do what they want?</font>

123
00:07:06,570 --> 00:07:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I went to all that
trouble of finding it...</font>

124
00:07:09,110 --> 00:07:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you want to desert Hinata?</font>

125
00:07:11,490 --> 00:07:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-How could anyone possibly do that?!</font>

126
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't desert her no matter
what might happen!</font>

127
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anybody who deserts a comrade is trash!</font>

128
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly.</font>

129
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then we'd be able to locate Sasuke
if we have this guy here...</font>

130
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well I guess we'll have to think of
some other method of finding Sasuke.</font>

131
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... Right now the first thing
we need to do is rescue Hinata.</font>

132
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:39,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But do you think Hinata
would be satisfied with that?</font>

133
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who originally
thought up this plan was Hinata.</font>

134
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? But...</font>

135
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true that I told her about
the existence of Bikochu...</font>

136
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

137
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:56,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The odds of finding
a Bikochu are extremely low...</font>

138
00:07:57,410 --> 00:08:00,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We thought that she should aspire
to an important mission</font>

139
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:04,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with an assured outcome for the village
rather than a mission with such low odds.</font>

140
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Hinata didn't give up.</font>

141
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She argued persistently that
if there was even a small possibility</font>

142
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one should take on the challenge.</font>

143
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-That Hinata did...?</font>

144
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was extremely forceful and
Shino and I had no choice but to agree.</font>

145
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time Hinata
ever volunteered for a mission.</font>

146
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For that reason too
I want to make this a success.</font>

147
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

148
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But when we don't know
where Hinata is how are we...?</font>

149
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is one place where Hinata
will definitely make an appearance.</font>

150
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! The place where...</font>

151
00:08:50,130 --> 00:08:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...the exchange with
the Bikochu takes place!</font>

152
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will definitely have
a chance at that time.</font>

153
00:08:56,090 --> 00:08:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!
We will recover Hinata without fail...</font>

154
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we will also protect
the Bikochu to the very end!</font>

155
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We brought the Bikochu!
Return Hinata!</font>

156
00:09:18,370 --> 00:09:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Place the insect cage
on that rock over there!</font>

157
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

158
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release Hinata!</font>

159
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must verify it first!</font>

160
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's... the meaning of this?!</font>

161
00:09:42,930 --> 00:09:46,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you trying to make a mockery
of our Clan? Of insect handlers?!</font>

162
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:51,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Goliath beetle...
You gotta be kidding!</font>

163
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now Shino!</font>

164
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

165
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Parasitic Insects!</font>

166
00:09:58,070 --> 00:09:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! Recovery successful!</font>

167
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

168
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:06,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

169
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

170
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right resign yourselves!</font>

171
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your time's up!</font>

172
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

173
00:10:26,930 --> 00:10:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one doesn't smell like Hinata!</font>

174
00:10:29,650 --> 00:10:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

175
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought...</font>

176
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beeswax...?</font>

177
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There they come!</font>

178
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! You jerk! You jerk!</font>

179
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! All these things are honey...?!</font>

180
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry Naruto...
But these damn bees!</font>

181
00:10:52,590 --> 00:10:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no end to them!</font>

182
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do we need to slash them
if they're honey?!</font>

183
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two don't move from there!</font>

184
00:11:00,890 --> 00:11:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

185
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the genuine thing!
And furthermore it contains deadly poison.</font>

186
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that genuine ones
are mixed in...</font>

187
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But they're indistinguishable
from each other!</font>

188
00:11:11,810 --> 00:11:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back me up for a little!</font>

189
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:15,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wall of Insects Jutsu!</font>

190
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Awesome...</font>

191
00:11:33,250 --> 00:11:35,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing power for a Genin...</font>

192
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As might be expected from
the Aburame Clan... I guess.</font>

193
00:11:42,890 --> 00:11:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kamizuru Clan...</font>

194
00:11:45,350 --> 00:11:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? So you were aware
of that fact.</font>

195
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Return Hinata!</font>

196
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course our intention was
to return her...</font>

197
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But only if you calmly hand over
the Bikochu.</font>

198
00:11:57,650 --> 00:11:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

199
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you have
no intention of doing that!</font>

200
00:12:01,450 --> 00:12:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case
what do you plan on doing?</font>

201
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're an insect handler</font>

202
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you wouldn't bring a delicate insect
like the Bikochu</font>

203
00:12:07,490 --> 00:12:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to a dangerous place
like a battleground...</font>

204
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll finish you off right here...</font>

205
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and take our time afterwards
to search for the Bikochu!</font>

206
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:19,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wall of Insects Jutsu!</font>

207
00:12:21,260 --> 00:12:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one doesn't have
any other tricks, huh!</font>

208
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino! Paper Bombs!</font>

209
00:12:39,610 --> 00:12:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

210
00:12:42,610 --> 00:12:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1000 Bee Stingers Jutsu!</font>

211
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insect Clones...?</font>

212
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up to your annoying tricks, huh...</font>

213
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino! What are we gonna do now?!</font>

214
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you think we should
go back there for a moment?</font>

215
00:13:07,970 --> 00:13:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys
might find the Bikochu!</font>

216
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:14,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... that location will definitely be safe.</font>

217
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly the first thing
we need to do is search for Hinata!</font>

218
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.</font>

219
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:41,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside here.</font>

220
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Where are you?!</font>

221
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Be careful!</font>

222
00:13:46,970 --> 00:13:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no sign of those guys
but it might be a trap...</font>

223
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is she there?!</font>

224
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...?</font>

225
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

226
00:14:05,190 --> 00:14:06,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right, Hinata?</font>

227
00:14:09,410 --> 00:14:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll rescue you in a moment!</font>

228
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more!</font>

229
00:14:28,340 --> 00:14:30,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right... I got it off!</font>

230
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:31,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

231
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you!</font>

232
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:35,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hinata...?!</font>

233
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hinata... stop that!</font>

234
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing
out of the blue like that?!</font>

235
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who... are you?</font>

236
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about, Shino?
That's Hinata.</font>

237
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're really Hinata</font>

238
00:14:55,910 --> 00:15:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'd get red in the face
and faint if you hugged Naruto.</font>

239
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Oh!</font>

240
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... But Akamaru's nose wouldn't fail...</font>

241
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:09,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? The smell of two people
is mingled?</font>

242
00:15:09,510 --> 00:15:11,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not Hinata?</font>

243
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... It's me...
I'm Hinata believe me.</font>

244
00:15:16,770 --> 00:15:17,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

245
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">show us what you tried to stick
on Naruto's back right now!</font>

246
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Paper Bomb?</font>

247
00:15:27,190 --> 00:15:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you were intending
to blow up Naruto!</font>

248
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:38,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought that would work...</font>

249
00:15:39,290 --> 00:15:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...</font>

250
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see the one on the hill
was a clone, huh...</font>

251
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:46,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wearing Hinata's clothes...</font>

252
00:15:47,050 --> 00:15:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how she was able
to compromise the smell.</font>

253
00:15:49,470 --> 00:15:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is the real Hinata?!</font>

254
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder where she could be?</font>

255
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

256
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Suzumebachi lured
the Aburame Clan, huh?</font>

257
00:16:07,940 --> 00:16:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it appears that your comrades...</font>

258
00:16:10,070 --> 00:16:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">place more value on the Bikochu
than on you.</font>

259
00:16:14,410 --> 00:16:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody else coming
to rescue you.</font>

260
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jibachi, let's search for
the Bikochu that those guys hid!</font>

261
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not much time until sunrise!</font>

262
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

263
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't even try to escape.</font>

264
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you make even the smallest movement
out of the ordinary</font>

265
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:36,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those bees will cut the string.</font>

266
00:16:37,010 --> 00:16:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up ahead is the entrance to
a labyrinthine underground water vein...</font>

267
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you fall in you'll pass into
the other world in an instant.</font>

268
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't wish to kill
anyone unnecessarily.</font>

269
00:16:51,190 --> 00:16:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to live
I suggest you just stay quiet.</font>

270
00:16:56,200 --> 00:17:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How mortifying... I ended up being
a burden to everyone after all.</font>

271
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are just like summer insects
who fly right into the fire!</font>

272
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're lucky we'll meet again...</font>

273
00:17:21,390 --> 00:17:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That place isn't just an ordinary cave.</font>

274
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Let go! Shino! Naruto!</font>

275
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing else to grab on to.</font>

276
00:17:35,950 --> 00:17:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be patient until I've checked
the surroundings!</font>

277
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

278
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A huge number of bee larvae!</font>

279
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:51,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bee larvae, huh...?</font>

280
00:17:52,130 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what's with their unusual huge size?</font>

281
00:17:55,260 --> 00:18:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you tell me where you hid the Bikochu
I'll spare your life.</font>

282
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I refuse!</font>

283
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Searching for the Bikochu is
the mission that we were given!</font>

284
00:18:08,150 --> 00:18:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then die!</font>

285
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper Bombs!</font>

286
00:18:13,150 --> 00:18:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Let's go, Akamaru!</font>

287
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

288
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sound is...</font>

289
00:18:22,910 --> 00:18:27,080
