298
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

299
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I won't give up either!</font>

300
00:19:17,630 --> 00:19:21,180
